        <title>Scoop</title>
        <link>https://Siborne.top/en/p/scoop/</link>
        <pubDate>Sun, 28 Dec 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
        
        <guid>https://Siborne.top/en/p/scoop/</guid>
        <description>&lt;img src="https://img.siborne.top/2026/05/51bac46210d74eba3c67533f21792b1e.png" alt="Featured image of post Scoop" /&gt;&lt;h2 id=&#34;why-use-scoop&#34;&gt;Why Use Scoop
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;scoop.sh&#34; &gt;Scoop Official Website&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On Windows, setting up a development environment has always been a complex and difficult problem. Due to the lack of a unified standard, various development environments have vastly different installation methods, requiring a lot of unnecessary time costs. Scoop can help you uniformly install and manage common development software, eliminating the need for manual downloading, installation, and configuring environment variables.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For example, installing Python and Node.js only requires executing:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-powershell&#34; data-lang=&#34;powershell&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;scoop&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;install&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;python&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;scoop&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;install&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;nodejs&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id=&#34;installing-scoop&#34;&gt;Installing Scoop
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tested + Official installation method&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Install the latest PowerShell from Microsoft Store&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://img.siborne.top/2026/05/55b1deed14935b83ece20483995372c7.png&#34;
	
	
	
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Open PowerShell and enter the following commands&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-powershell&#34; data-lang=&#34;powershell&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nb&#34;&gt;Set-ExecutionPolicy&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;-ExecutionPolicy&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;RemoteSigned&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;-Scope&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;CurrentUser&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nb&#34;&gt;Invoke-RestMethod&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;-Uri&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;https&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;err&#34;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;//&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;get&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;py&#34;&gt;scoop&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;py&#34;&gt;sh&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;|&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nb&#34;&gt;Invoke-Expression&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you see the image below, the installation was successful&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://img.siborne.top/2026/05/8234824b2239baec3c02061c17f37ac2.png&#34;
	
	
	
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Scoop requires &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://aka.ms/wmf5download&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Windows PowerShell 5.1&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://aka.ms/powershell&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;PowerShell&lt;/a&gt; as its runtime environment. If you&amp;rsquo;re using Windows 10 or later, Windows PowerShell is built into the system. However, Windows 7&amp;rsquo;s built-in Windows PowerShell version is too outdated, and you&amp;rsquo;ll need to manually install a newer version of PowerShell.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Since many users have set up Windows accounts with Chinese usernames, this causes the user directory to also have a Chinese name. If you install software to the user directory using Scoop&amp;rsquo;s default method, it may cause some software to execute incorrectly. Therefore, I recommend installing to a custom directory. For other installation methods, please refer to: &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/ScoopInstaller/Install&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;ScoopInstaller/Install&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;5
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;6
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-powershell&#34; data-lang=&#34;powershell&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;c&#34;&gt;# Set PowerShell execution policy&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nb&#34;&gt;Set-ExecutionPolicy&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;-ExecutionPolicy&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;RemoteSigned&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;-Scope&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;CurrentUser&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;c&#34;&gt;# Download installation script&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nb&#34;&gt;irm &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;get&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;py&#34;&gt;scoop&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;py&#34;&gt;sh&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;-outfile&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;s1&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;install.ps1&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;c&#34;&gt;# Execute installation, --ScoopDir parameter specifies Scoop installation path&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;.\&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;install&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;py&#34;&gt;ps1&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;-ScoopDir&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;s1&#34;&gt;&amp;#39;C:\Scoop&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id=&#34;using-scoop&#34;&gt;Using Scoop
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Scoop&amp;rsquo;s official documentation is very beginner-friendly. Rather than repeating information here, I recommend reading the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/ScoopInstaller/Scoop&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;official documentation&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/ScoopInstaller/Scoop/wiki/Quick-Start&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Quick Start&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&#34;common-commands&#34;&gt;Common Commands
&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;table&gt;
	&lt;thead&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Command&lt;/th&gt;
					&lt;th style=&#34;text-align: center&#34;&gt;Function&lt;/th&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/thead&gt;
	&lt;tbody&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;scoop bucket list&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td style=&#34;text-align: center&#34;&gt;View all currently installed repos&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;scoop search&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td style=&#34;text-align: center&#34;&gt;Used to search software&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;scoop install&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td style=&#34;text-align: center&#34;&gt;Used to install software&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;scoop list&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td style=&#34;text-align: center&#34;&gt;Used to view installed software&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;scoop uninstall&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td style=&#34;text-align: center&#34;&gt;Used to uninstall software&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;scoop bucket&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td style=&#34;text-align: center&#34;&gt;Used to manage repositories&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;scoop update&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td style=&#34;text-align: center&#34;&gt;Used to update software&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;scoop config proxy&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td style=&#34;text-align: center&#34;&gt;Set proxy for scoop&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;scoop reset&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td style=&#34;text-align: center&#34;&gt;Used to switch software versions&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;qa&#34;&gt;Q&amp;amp;A
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;can-scoop-configure-mirror-sources&#34;&gt;Can Scoop configure mirror sources?
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Scoop community only maintains installation configurations. All software is downloaded from the official download links provided by the software developers, so mirror sources cannot be provided. If multiple downloads fail due to your network environment, you&amp;rsquo;ll need a little &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://csdiy.wiki/%E5%BF%85%E5%AD%A6%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7/%E7%BF%BB%E5%A2%99/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;magic&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;why-cant-i-find-java8&#34;&gt;Why can&amp;rsquo;t I find Java8?
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;For the same reason as above, the official source no longer provides Java8 download links. It&amp;rsquo;s recommended to use &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/ScoopInstaller/Java/blob/master/bucket/ojdkbuild8.json&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;ojdkbuild8&lt;/a&gt; as an alternative.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;how-do-i-install-python2&#34;&gt;How do I install Python2?
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;For deprecated software, the Scoop community removes it from &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/ScoopInstaller/Main&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;ScoopInstaller/Main&lt;/a&gt; and adds it to &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/ScoopInstaller/Versions&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;ScoopInstaller/Versions&lt;/a&gt;. If you need these software, you&amp;rsquo;ll need to manually add the bucket:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-powershell&#34; data-lang=&#34;powershell&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;scoop&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;bucket&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;add&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;versions&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;scoop&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;install&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;python27&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;‍&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://google.com&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://www.google.com/images/branding/googlelogo/1x/googlelogo_light_color_272x92dp.png&#34;
	
	
	
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;Google&#34;
	
	
&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
